WEBVTT

00:04.190 --> 00:05.370
Ta-da.

00:05.370 --> 00:08.220
Starting today, this place will be our diary!

00:08.220 --> 00:12.790
With this, can we ask Tomo many things, like questions about basketball.

00:12.790 --> 00:16.240
I-I look forward to seeing everyone here!

00:16.240 --> 00:19.650
I'm really happy that you guys invited me here.

00:19.650 --> 00:23.540
Tomoka-chan, you don't need to be so formal.

00:23.540 --> 00:24.580
Oh~!

00:24.580 --> 00:26.600
Just act natural.

00:26.600 --> 00:27.930
Yup...

00:27.930 --> 00:28.750
I'll try my best.

00:28.750 --> 00:29.930
That's right, that's right.

00:29.930 --> 00:32.310
We're teammates now.

00:32.310 --> 00:35.150
Was that a little too cool?

00:35.150 --> 00:36.060
Idiot.

00:36.060 --> 00:38.150
What's up with that?!

00:38.150 --> 00:41.040
Thank you, Misawa-san, Nagatsuka-san.

00:41.040 --> 00:42.820
Surnames aren't allowed!

00:42.820 --> 00:44.110
Ah, okay...

00:44.110 --> 00:44.910
Um...

00:44.910 --> 00:48.610
Maho, Saki, Airi, Hinata.

00:48.610 --> 00:51.030
I look forward to hanging out with you guys.

01:00.030 --> 01:03.370
Don't give up and do your best

01:03.370 --> 01:06.750
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:06.750 --> 01:09.790
I know perfectly

01:09.790 --> 01:13.460
How weak a person is on their own

01:13.670 --> 01:16.630
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:16.630 --> 01:20.300
I hold them close to my chest

01:20.300 --> 01:23.270
Your gentle words

01:23.270 --> 01:27.230
Caress my cheeks

01:27.230 --> 01:30.270
The irritation that has been building up

01:30.270 --> 01:33.070
From wanting to reach the goal

01:33.070 --> 01:37.240
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:37.240 --> 01:40.830
The place that warms it up

01:40.830 --> 01:43.740
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:43.740 --> 01:47.250
We have to protect this

01:47.250 --> 01:48.710
We're unripe fighters!

01:48.710 --> 01:50.630
We won't lose now

01:50.630 --> 01:54.010
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:54.010 --> 01:57.430
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:57.430 --> 02:00.890
Then release it towards the sky!

02:00.890 --> 02:02.430
The courage that cannot be stopped

02:02.430 --> 02:04.270
jump and shoot

02:02.430 --> 02:04.270
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:04.270 --> 02:07.180
I will pass the ball to you

02:07.180 --> 02:11.480
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:11.480 --> 02:15.030
Game

02:11.480 --> 02:15.030
Will move the game along

02:31.380 --> 02:33.540
Yay!

02:33.540 --> 02:34.960
Nice shot, Tomo!

02:38.720 --> 02:39.550
All right!

02:39.550 --> 02:40.470
We can do this!

02:48.190 --> 02:48.810
Airi!

02:51.270 --> 02:52.150
I...

02:52.150 --> 02:53.850
...won't run away anymore!

02:53.850 --> 02:54.820
Because I'm the centre!

02:55.610 --> 02:58.400
She's putting your teachings into practice.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.070
Tomoka-chan!

03:05.320 --> 03:06.490
All right!

03:08.910 --> 03:10.610
You guys are doing great,

03:10.160 --> 03:12.080
Nice pass!

03:10.610 --> 03:12.080
Saki, Airi, Tomoka!

03:16.670 --> 03:19.010
Okay, we're getting this ball in.

03:19.410 --> 03:20.590
This is stupid.

03:26.600 --> 03:29.270
You seem like you can do this alone.

03:30.420 --> 03:33.520
But we're on a different level from you.

03:44.870 --> 03:46.910
Offensive charging, number 5.

03:52.220 --> 03:53.450
Oh~!

03:53.450 --> 03:54.920
Are you okay?

03:54.920 --> 03:56.650
Yes, I'm sorry.

03:56.650 --> 03:57.960
I'm fine.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.630
Seems like you got lucky.

03:59.630 --> 04:00.750
Huh?!

04:00.750 --> 04:02.450
Didn't <i>you</i> guys foul <i>us</i>?

04:02.450 --> 04:03.600
Maho!

04:07.610 --> 04:08.390
Saki!

04:11.370 --> 04:13.370
Don't underestimate Hina!

04:13.370 --> 04:14.150
Oh~!

04:14.150 --> 04:15.350
I'm going in!

04:15.350 --> 04:17.360
Sorry, but I'm stopping you.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.730
So low!

04:20.860 --> 04:22.030
Oh~!

04:27.870 --> 04:29.730
That was so cool, Hina!

04:29.730 --> 04:30.440
Oh~!

04:30.440 --> 04:31.450
Thank you!

04:31.940 --> 04:34.710
A reverse shot using both hands...

04:34.710 --> 04:36.590
When did she master a move like that?

04:36.590 --> 04:39.340
She picked it up gradually before the summer holidays.

04:39.340 --> 04:42.130
However, it's still the first time she's done that in a match.

04:42.130 --> 04:44.380
Amazing, Hinata-chan...

04:44.750 --> 04:47.050
Well, what you're saying applies to everyone.

04:50.140 --> 04:51.560
Take this!

04:51.560 --> 04:53.380
As if I'd let you!

05:00.850 --> 05:01.940
The shot counts.

05:01.940 --> 05:02.740
One free throw.

05:02.740 --> 05:03.940
Yeah!

05:07.490 --> 05:08.280
All right!

05:10.990 --> 05:12.620
What's with this?

05:15.660 --> 05:17.710
They're better than I thought they'd be.

05:23.670 --> 05:25.090
You're a bother!

05:30.430 --> 05:31.810
That's...

05:32.560 --> 05:35.430
Chibi-Ribbon, that was because you took Mo-kan lightly.

05:35.430 --> 05:36.860
S-Shut up!

05:36.860 --> 05:38.230
I don't care-

05:38.230 --> 05:39.610
Miu!

05:39.610 --> 05:40.650
I know!

05:44.150 --> 05:45.210
Geez!

05:45.210 --> 05:46.360
Miu!

05:46.360 --> 05:48.010
You're late on the rebound!

05:48.010 --> 05:50.050
What are you doing?

05:50.050 --> 05:51.450
That's not true, Coach.

05:51.920 --> 05:54.950
I'm not really interested in this match, so it can't be helped.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.960
We're just adjusting, so-

05:56.960 --> 05:58.920
Stop talking like a loser.

05:58.920 --> 06:01.790
Are you really a Suzuridani regular, Miu?

06:04.210 --> 06:05.840
Keishin is strong.

06:05.840 --> 06:09.680
If you still want to play a trash game, go home.

06:13.430 --> 06:14.600
I'm sorry.

06:17.180 --> 06:18.230
Do your best!

06:21.090 --> 06:23.360
That's Manaka-senpai, all right.

06:23.360 --> 06:25.860
Now she'll start playing seriously.

06:25.860 --> 06:27.320
That's rather troublesome.

06:27.320 --> 06:30.410
But, that's what makes it interesting.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.410
I've been going a little too easy on you.

06:33.870 --> 06:35.830
I won't let you get past me like that again.

06:49.100 --> 06:50.220
I won't let you take this!

06:50.220 --> 06:51.930
Weak people should just move aside!

06:52.320 --> 06:55.350
The only reason why I, the shortest person, am the captain is...

06:55.350 --> 06:58.770
...skill, skill and more skill!

07:03.940 --> 07:05.270
Amazing...

07:08.230 --> 07:12.780
I can get past people bigger than me and always get the shot in,

07:12.780 --> 07:14.870
because I'm on a completely different level from you.

07:14.870 --> 07:15.740
Understand?

07:18.580 --> 07:19.250
Hina!

07:21.500 --> 07:21.980
Oh~!

07:23.020 --> 07:24.040
Saki!

07:25.700 --> 07:27.050
To think you ignored me...

07:27.500 --> 07:28.760
You weakling!

07:34.140 --> 07:39.350
I'm playing against someone taller and better than me every day.

07:39.810 --> 07:41.310
You're cocky...

07:41.310 --> 07:42.390
But you're not too bad.

07:44.650 --> 07:46.270
Every day...

07:46.270 --> 07:47.570
Subaru, what does that-

07:47.570 --> 07:49.400
It's time to start "that".

07:54.780 --> 07:56.450
Everyone, let's try "that" out.

07:56.450 --> 07:57.830
Airi, can you do it?

07:57.830 --> 07:59.080
Yes!

07:59.080 --> 08:01.210
I'll do everything I can!

08:01.210 --> 08:02.790
We're counting on you, Airin!

08:02.790 --> 08:04.630
We'll follow up as best we can.

08:04.630 --> 08:05.830
Let's win for sure!

08:05.830 --> 08:07.040
Oh!

08:10.840 --> 08:12.760
Let's go.

08:21.140 --> 08:22.240
Okay!

08:23.060 --> 08:23.890
Hinata!

08:23.890 --> 08:25.480
Oh~!

08:25.480 --> 08:26.360
Got it!

08:26.360 --> 08:28.110
All right, you're open!

08:32.070 --> 08:33.900
This is...

08:34.570 --> 08:37.160
One centre and four shooters.

08:37.160 --> 08:39.980
If they have two people defending Airi,

08:39.980 --> 08:43.080
one person will be open and can shoot from outside.

08:43.080 --> 08:46.000
But if you miss one person, you won't be able to shoot.

08:46.000 --> 08:49.670
A cooperative centre and an organised group of shooters.

08:49.670 --> 08:51.550
It's a strategy that suits us.

08:51.550 --> 08:53.470
It's incomplete at the moment, though.

09:20.740 --> 09:21.910
Everyone...

09:21.910 --> 09:24.830
Honestly, I'm worried about everyone's stamina.

09:24.830 --> 09:27.540
But, if they continue like this...

09:28.080 --> 09:30.790
Try your best for just a little longer!

09:31.380 --> 09:33.590
Everyone, we're going with a one-two!

09:33.590 --> 09:36.010
I've been waiting for this!

09:36.010 --> 09:38.760
I'm sorry, but I won't lose to you.

09:49.560 --> 09:52.360
Seems that you lack lower body strength!

09:53.360 --> 09:54.280
Miu!

09:58.070 --> 09:59.620
Damn!

09:59.620 --> 10:01.200
You're just a Chibi-Ribbon...

10:01.200 --> 10:02.240
Sure am.

10:02.240 --> 10:05.000
If you're not happy about it, why
don't you win with your shooting?

10:11.250 --> 10:14.430
Basketball really is fun.

10:14.430 --> 10:15.710
Yeah.

10:16.190 --> 10:17.710
This feeling...

10:17.710 --> 10:20.390
This feeling is everything I've got.

10:22.180 --> 10:26.060
I wanted to quit basketball.

10:26.060 --> 10:29.020
But, thanks to you guys and Subaru-san,

10:29.740 --> 10:33.190
I can love basketball again.

10:33.190 --> 10:37.530
That's why I want to try my best
playing basketball with this team.

10:37.530 --> 10:40.660
Right now, that means everything to me!

10:41.320 --> 10:45.580
Honestly, I didn't like basketball that much at first.

10:45.580 --> 10:50.290
But now I can do things that I
couldn't before, and I just can't stop!

10:50.290 --> 10:52.460
I can't stop playing basketball now!

10:53.170 --> 10:57.010
I was scared at first, but as I tried my best with everyone,

10:57.010 --> 11:00.380
the scary things slowly turned into fun things.

11:00.930 --> 11:04.180
That's why I love playing basketball with everyone!

11:05.140 --> 11:07.180
I used to be really pathetic,

11:07.800 --> 11:10.810
but everyone stuck with me and cheered me on.

11:11.230 --> 11:12.860
That's why I didn't give up.

11:12.860 --> 11:16.730
Whether it's tomorrow, or the day after, I'll keep trying my best!

11:17.280 --> 11:19.990
If I'm together with everyone, it'll be fun.

11:19.990 --> 11:21.780
Even if we don't participate in a tournament,

11:21.780 --> 11:23.950
just playing basketball by ourselves is really fun!

11:23.950 --> 11:25.280
It makes me excited.

11:25.280 --> 11:29.450
That's why you should teach me more, Subarun!

11:31.330 --> 11:32.520
All right!

11:32.520 --> 11:33.790
Hold out for just a little longer!

11:34.960 --> 11:35.740
Hurry!

11:35.740 --> 11:36.550
Miu!

11:46.010 --> 11:48.180
It's crunch time.

11:49.380 --> 11:50.180
Saki!

12:05.900 --> 12:06.870
Saki!

12:10.630 --> 12:11.410
Saki!

12:16.860 --> 12:18.000
Saki!

12:52.000 --> 12:54.280
[First Swimsuit] Her mother's swimsuit,

12:52.000 --> 12:55.000
which she secretly took to wear

13:28.970 --> 13:30.970
Hey, Subaru.

13:31.770 --> 13:34.570
I got a text from Manaka-senpai.

13:34.570 --> 13:36.120
How's it going with that?

13:38.410 --> 13:40.870
Training starts today.

14:20.430 --> 14:24.640
There are still many things I have to do!

14:31.340 --> 14:33.180
Minato.

14:33.970 --> 14:34.760
Yo.

14:34.760 --> 14:35.560
What a coincidence.

14:37.800 --> 14:39.100
I heard about it.

14:39.100 --> 14:41.860
You guys lost to Suzuridani in the match by just one point.

14:43.730 --> 14:45.560
You already know about it.

14:45.560 --> 14:47.530
You guys aren't actually that bad after all.

14:48.650 --> 14:50.700
I'm saying you guys worked hard.

14:51.900 --> 14:53.080
See you.

15:06.540 --> 15:07.950
What's up?

15:07.950 --> 15:09.300
Are you still bothered about that?

15:11.380 --> 15:15.930
I think I should've passed to you or Tomo back then.

15:16.640 --> 15:18.470
Because of me...

15:18.470 --> 15:19.800
...we lost.

15:22.350 --> 15:24.600
Hey, what are you laughing about?

15:24.600 --> 15:28.790
Aren't you blaming yourself too much?

15:28.790 --> 15:32.780
Have you forgotten that basketball is played by a team of five?

15:32.780 --> 15:34.570
I don't need you to tell me-

15:36.490 --> 15:38.620
If so, don't say things like that!

15:42.120 --> 15:46.670
Saki, you were amazing during that match.

15:46.670 --> 15:49.920
I lost my cool because I wanted to beat Chibi-Ribbon.

15:50.590 --> 15:53.340
Thanks to you, I came back to my usual self.

15:56.130 --> 15:57.380
Maho...

16:02.180 --> 16:04.350
Hina-chan, are you okay?

16:04.930 --> 16:06.060
Oh~!

16:06.060 --> 16:07.520
I'm not done yet!

16:07.520 --> 16:09.530
Don't push yourself too hard.

16:09.530 --> 16:10.520
Bu~!

16:10.520 --> 16:13.280
I'm fine with this much!

16:15.570 --> 16:16.980
How may I help you?

16:16.980 --> 16:17.910
This is Nobidome.

16:18.440 --> 16:22.000
I'm Takamura, the advisor of Keishin Academy's girls' basketball team.

16:22.410 --> 16:27.010
I'm sorry to have caused you trouble by not turning up at the training camp.

16:27.010 --> 16:27.920
It's nothing.

16:28.280 --> 16:33.630
I heard from my nephew that you let our team play a match against your regulars.

16:33.630 --> 16:35.140
Thank you very much.

16:35.530 --> 16:36.630
It's nothing.

16:36.630 --> 16:39.440
If someone were to say thanks, it would have to be me.

16:39.440 --> 16:43.060
I'm really grateful to Hasegawa-kun.

16:43.510 --> 16:48.480
Thanks to that match, my students and I have remembered something very important.

16:49.530 --> 16:51.610
Having fun while playing basketball,

16:51.610 --> 16:53.200
playing basketball to have fun.

16:54.030 --> 16:55.740
We only cared about results,

16:55.740 --> 16:58.760
and we were about to throw out the most important part of basketball.

16:59.490 --> 17:01.410
He taught us that.

17:01.410 --> 17:02.830
I see.

17:02.830 --> 17:06.830
I'm always being taught by kids, too.

17:07.300 --> 17:11.000
That might just be what it means to be a teacher.

17:20.060 --> 17:22.180
It started here.

17:23.140 --> 17:26.020
Everyone improved so much...

17:26.370 --> 17:27.980
Grew up so much...

17:28.360 --> 17:29.520
Even though I was supposed to be teaching them,

17:30.160 --> 17:32.230
they ended up teaching me a lot.

18:00.330 --> 18:02.100
Um...!

18:05.760 --> 18:07.940
Welcome back, Master!

18:09.310 --> 18:10.900
Tomo... ka...

18:11.650 --> 18:12.860
What's the matter?

18:13.900 --> 18:14.820
Um...

18:15.570 --> 18:17.490
Um, it's...

18:21.450 --> 18:24.540
I'll do anything Subaru-san wants!

18:24.540 --> 18:29.460
If Subaru-san will cheer up...

18:29.460 --> 18:37.000
Even though we're always being taught and encouraged by Subaru-san, we still lost...

18:37.800 --> 18:38.380
That's why...

18:38.760 --> 18:40.300
We'll definitely win the next match!

18:40.680 --> 18:42.140
We want to win!

18:43.470 --> 18:48.480
But we don't know if we can take part in an official tournament,

18:48.480 --> 18:52.900
so we'll have to find other ways to... for Subaru-san...

18:53.770 --> 18:59.950
Please order me to do anything, Master.

19:02.780 --> 19:04.200
Okay.

19:04.200 --> 19:07.250
All right, I'll take that offer.

19:39.900 --> 19:42.030
Thank you, Tomoka.

19:48.120 --> 19:50.540
What, it was just a jump shot?

19:50.540 --> 19:54.380
I was expecting something more exciting.

19:54.380 --> 19:56.880
Why do you think we left the two of you alone?

19:58.210 --> 20:02.300
Since Subaru-san looked like he'd been down in the dumps,

20:02.790 --> 20:06.760
I asked them what we should do, and then...

20:07.160 --> 20:10.180
We thought that Tomo would be able to comfort you best.

20:10.180 --> 20:14.980
That's why I said all she has to do is
give him a girl's most precious thing.

20:14.980 --> 20:17.820
Can you please go and find out what that means?!

20:17.820 --> 20:19.150
Oh~!

20:19.150 --> 20:22.460
Onii-chan, I will do anything for you, too.

20:22.460 --> 20:24.900
Will you cheer up then?

20:25.460 --> 20:26.650
Hasegawa-san!

20:26.650 --> 20:28.640
I'm determined, too!

20:28.640 --> 20:30.250
I won't run away anymore!

20:31.660 --> 20:34.040
I'm sorry for making everyone worry about me.

20:34.040 --> 20:38.800
I was thinking about what to do after the match.

20:38.800 --> 20:41.880
I wasn't unhappy or anything like that.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.760
Is that true?

20:43.760 --> 20:45.370
Yeah.

20:45.370 --> 20:48.680
Even though we lost the match, I think everyone was really strong.

20:49.640 --> 20:53.350
It was just a tiny lack of stamina and luck.

20:54.520 --> 20:59.400
That's why we should practise more and become even stronger!

21:01.530 --> 21:04.320
♪Party love Party love Party love (fuufuu)

21:04.320 --> 21:06.530
I want to grow up quickly

21:06.530 --> 21:07.620
(Yes-!)

21:07.880 --> 21:09.000
Yes!

21:09.910 --> 21:13.690
Hey, as thanks for coaching us,

21:13.690 --> 21:16.370
let's give Subarun a massage, everyone!

21:16.370 --> 21:17.540
Why?

21:17.540 --> 21:18.380
Oh~!

21:18.080 --> 21:19.380
Pushing is no good!

21:18.380 --> 21:19.670
Let's do that!

21:19.420 --> 21:20.590
Pulling is no good!

21:19.670 --> 21:21.840
Hasegawa-san, please lie down on the floor.

21:20.590 --> 21:23.340
You say you're still young

21:21.840 --> 21:23.550
No, it's fine.

21:23.340 --> 21:24.590
But we don't want that

21:23.550 --> 21:25.510
Come on, there's no need to hold back.

21:24.590 --> 21:26.340
That's still the future

21:25.510 --> 21:27.340
There's really no need.

21:26.340 --> 21:28.800
I want to grow up faster!

21:27.340 --> 21:29.220
There!

21:28.800 --> 21:30.140
Inside the bath

21:30.140 --> 21:31.470
Giving you a message

21:31.470 --> 21:34.180
Self-care is impossible

21:31.600 --> 21:34.930
Hey, Subaru, I brought you a present-

21:34.180 --> 21:35.560
I've shown you courage..

21:35.560 --> 21:37.560
However, I'm bashful after all

21:36.520 --> 21:39.520
What are you doing, Subaru?!

21:37.560 --> 21:39.650
I want to grow up faster!

21:39.520 --> 21:41.070
It's not what you think it is!

21:39.650 --> 21:40.320
Rebound!

21:40.980 --> 21:42.730
One two Step!

21:41.070 --> 21:41.610
Help me!

21:41.610 --> 21:44.900
To think you'd do things like this to children!

21:42.730 --> 21:45.240
I'm not joking

21:45.240 --> 21:50.410
Let's have a 1-on-1 match

21:46.030 --> 21:48.820
I even believed in you!

21:50.410 --> 21:52.830
With you

21:52.370 --> 21:56.210
Okay, let's eat this after practice!

21:53.160 --> 21:55.660
"Well then everyone, let's go together"

21:55.660 --> 21:58.670
Jump! Jump!

21:56.210 --> 21:58.000
Yes!

21:58.000 --> 22:01.340
Hey, Subaru, you should start practice now.

21:58.670 --> 22:01.000
More and more and more...

22:01.340 --> 22:04.010
Weren't you the one who started all the trouble?!

22:01.670 --> 22:06.550
If we can stand on our tiptoes we can reach the distance

22:06.550 --> 22:09.470
I'm growing! It's painful!

22:09.470 --> 22:12.560
The painful sores.

22:12.560 --> 22:17.270
That's right, I'll show you I can win this!

22:17.270 --> 22:18.730
Shake (Shake)

22:18.730 --> 22:20.100
Bounce (Bounce)

22:20.100 --> 22:21.360
Touch (Touch)

22:21.360 --> 22:24.780
Aim for the goal!

22:24.780 --> 22:27.740
Ah!! I want to grow up faster!

22:28.700 --> 22:31.370
♪Party love Party love Party love

